      "content": "REST API for Nitro PDF Services: convert, transform, extract, and generate PDF documents, plus async job status/result retrieval. Machine-to-machine OAuth 2.0 client-credentials; short-lived bearer tokens. Assembled by API Evangelist from Nitro's published per-tool OpenAPI reference fragments; schemas preserved verbatim.",
